        "## 2. Calculamos agua y aptitud\n",
        "\n",
        "Definimos agua tratada $T=\\sum_iD_i k_i/10$, agua potable $P=\\sum_iD_i-T$ y exceso $E=\\max(0,T-C)$. Minimizamos $P$ sujeto al dominio y $T\\le C$.\n",
        "\n",
        "Ordenamos candidatos con $F=P/\\sum D_i$ si son factibles y $F=1+E/C$ si exceden la capacidad. Menor aptitud es mejor. Una solución factible tiene $F\\le1$; una infactible tiene $F>1$. Usamos tolerancia numérica de $10^{-8}$ m³.\n",
        "\n",
        "Antes de ejecutar, calcula a mano $k=(6,6,6,6)$: $T=0.6(2276.21)=1365.726$, $P=910.484$, $E=0$, $F=0.4$. Explica por qué cumple la capacidad y qué unidad tiene cada resultado."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 3,
      "id": "b025b093",
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-08T15:30:00.149409Z",
          "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-08T15:30:00.149019Z",
          "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-08T15:30:00.155929Z",
          "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-08T15:30:00.154848Z"
        },
        "id": "b025b093"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def evaluate(genes: np.ndarray) -> dict:\n",
        "    \"\"\"Return physical totals and fitness (lower is better) for four integer genes.\"\"\"\n",
        "    genes = np.asarray(genes)\n",
        "    if genes.shape != (4,) or not np.issubdtype(genes.dtype, np.integer):\n",
        "        raise ValueError(\"Expected four integer genes in building order.\")\n",
        "    if np.any(genes < 0) or np.any(genes > LIMITS):\n",
        "        raise ValueError(\"Genes outside the allowed building domains.\")\n",
        "    treated = float(np.sum(DEMAND * genes / 10))\n",
        "    potable = float(np.sum(DEMAND) - treated)\n",
        "    excess = max(0.0, treated - CAPACITY)\n",
        "    feasible = excess <= 1e-8\n",
        "    fitness = potable / float(np.sum(DEMAND)) if feasible else 1 + excess / CAPACITY\n",
        "    return dict(treated=treated, potable=potable, excess=excess,\n",
        "                feasible=feasible, fitness=fitness)"
      ]
    },
